a good thing for kids.

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:03.390
Getting used to losing is a
really, really good thing.

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:08.390
And a lot of societies under performance

00:13:08.418 --> 00:13:11.721
comes from insecurity which comes

00:13:11.721 --> 00:13:14.300
