00:44:45.768 --> 00:44:47.960
from somebody else who feels

00:44:47.960 --> 00:44:50.010
like they're doing a better job than you.

00:44:51.030 --> 00:44:52.000
Yeah.

00:44:52.000 --> 00:44:52.860
- And don't forget.

00:44:52.860 --> 00:44:55.000
Parenting is like a sports game.

00:44:55.000 --> 00:44:56.490
That mom may be thinking

00:44:56.490 --> 00:44:58.110
they're doing a better job than you,

00:44:58.110 --> 00:45:00.540
But the score is 17 to seven

00:45:00.540 --> 00:45:03.030
in the first quarter of a basketball game.

00:45:03.030 --> 00:45:07.127
One thing that might help you,
Nicole is say, "That's cute.

00:45:07.127 --> 00:45:10.030
"But let's see how these
kids' lives turn out."

00:45:10.030 --> 00:45:13.920
And oh, by the way, parents
having their self-esteem

00:45:13.920 --> 00:45:15.765
wrapped up in what their kid's doing

00:45:15.765 --> 00:45:18.810
is the ultimate vulnerability.

00:45:18.810 --> 00:45:20.890
You can be proud and love your kid,

00:45:20.890 --> 00:45:24.000
but like too many parents
are deep in this shit now

00:45:24.000 --> 00:45:25.994
and whether the kid is nice,

00:45:25.994 --> 00:45:29.890
dresses slutty, is good at
sports, is not, a good student.

00:45:29.890 --> 00:45:31.930
All that shit has gotten way too close.

00:45:31.930 --> 00:45:35.060
The reason we've gotten
too deep in this shit,

00:45:35.060 --> 00:45:38.760
people really had better
boundaries in the past.

00:45:38.760 --> 00:45:39.810
Kids went outside,

00:45:39.810 --> 00:45:41.830
parents didn't know every
fucking little thing.

00:45:41.830 --> 00:45:43.122
I had 800 things brewing.

00:45:43.122 --> 00:45:45.130
My mom knew none of that.

00:45:45.130 --> 00:45:46.440
And I think that's another thing

00:45:46.440 --> 00:45:49.030
for you to layer into
this conversation, Nicole.

00:45:49.030 --> 00:45:51.310
If you think that Sally
Magoo who's judging you

00:45:51.310 --> 00:45:54.050
has any fucking clue of what's
going on with their child.

00:45:54.050 --> 00:45:55.050
That makes me laugh.

00:45:58.720 --> 00:46:01.100
- [Nicole] Yeah, yeah.

00:46:01.100 --> 00:46:02.053
That hits home.

00:46:03.210 --> 00:46:05.060
