00:46:05.060 --> 00:46:07.630
and that is a really,
really tough field to be in.

00:46:07.630 --> 00:46:09.100
It's like the dance moms world,

00:46:09.100 --> 00:46:10.900
if you've ever seen that show.

00:46:10.900 --> 00:46:12.680
And that's definitely not my scene.

00:46:12.680 --> 00:46:16.607
