I do my work and yeah.

00:46:16.607 --> 00:46:18.100
And it's definitely tough,

00:46:18.100 --> 00:46:21.310
because not only are they
in their kids' business

00:46:21.310 --> 00:46:23.510
but they're in everybody,
else's kids business.

00:46:23.510 --> 00:46:26.740
- Right, it's unfortunate.

00:46:26.740 --> 00:46:29.178
And really once you flip your mind

00:46:29.178 --> 00:46:31.893
into feeling compassion for them,

00:46:32.850 --> 00:46:34.560
instead of anger towards them,

00:46:34.560 --> 00:46:35.850
